full-query: "You are using a configuration management system to manage your Amazon EC2 instances. On your Amazon EC2 Instances, you want to store credentials for connecting to an Amazon RDS MYSQL DB instance. How would you securely access these credentials when the number of connections per second is lesser than 500?"
